# PANODROME — Cursor Rules (mirrors CLAUDE.md)

# ⚡ BOOT: read MEMORY_STATE.json (≤50 lines) at turn start. NEVER bulk-read docs/* on startup.
# 🚫 Forbidden on boot: docs/00-source-chat-gemini.md, docs/01-*, docs/02-*

## Project
- Name: **Panodrome** (locked 2026-11-01, Issue #1) — "Spatial & Living Architecture Pinterest".
- Core: 360° equirect panoramas → true first-person walkable ROOM VOLUMES (Stage 1.5: metric shoebox
  projection — flat floor, plumb walls, per-fragment equirect shader), real multi-metre walking with
  sliding furniture collision, doorway portals with 4 routing modes (Architect / Style / Room Type /
  Random — walk into the ring to travel), warm low-passed acoustic footsteps + ambience.
- Language: English-first + full RTL Persian (`fa`) from Day 1.
- Stack: Three.js + GSAP (free) + WebGL + PolyHaven CC0 + Wikimedia Commons.

## Locked decisions (do not revisit)
- Name = Panodrome · EN-first + FA RTL · Three.js/GSAP/PolyHaven CC0 · straight to Phase 1 (no static mockups).

## Repository topology (Anti-Fragmentation Lock — 2026-11-02)
- `3d-idea` (private) = ONLY workspace & source of truth: ALL code, public/, skills/, data/, MEMORY_STATE.json are edited & committed ONLY here.
- `panodrome` (public) = dumb build-output mirror for Pages; written ONLY by `scripts/deploy_gh_pages.sh` (mirror README.md is auto-generated). NEVER clone it, NEVER hand-edit it, NEVER PR to it.
- ONE project working copy on disk: `/home/z/my-project/3d-idea` — no leftover temp clones/worktrees.
- End of session: `git status` in 3d-idea clean, `main` pushed.

## Iron law
1. Turn start: read `MEMORY_STATE.json` only.
2. Turn end: update `MEMORY_STATE.json` (current_phase, completed_modules, active_decisions, next_immediate_action) + commit.
3. `docs/` is archive; open only when the task targets that doc.
4. Canonical rooms DB = `data/rooms_db.json`; static deploy copy = `public/data/rooms_db.json`.

## Conventions
- Commit prefixes: `phase1:` `memory:` `docs:` `skill:`.
- All UI strings EN + FA (`public/js/i18n.js`); FA fully RTL.
- CC0 content only; credit creators always.
- Depth v1 = procedural box-room prior; upgrade hook = `--depth-backend replicate-da2` (DA2/PanDA).
- GitHub token arrives via env var `T` only — never written to any file.

## 5-Stage Gated Pipeline (SYSTEM RESET — 2026-11-02)
- Previous Phase 2.5/3/4 build FAILED architectural QA (vertex-warped walls, oscillator fake footsteps, mobile overflow, Tahoma fallback, random pins, churches/stations). System reset applied.
- Stage 1 (zero-distortion core) = INSPECTED by owner 2026-11-02: typography approved, movement rejected ("camera zooming, not walking") → owner ordered the Stage 1.5 upgrade.
- Stage 1.5 (true first-person physics: room-volume projection + sliding collision + routing modes + soft audio + 10 rooms) = DELIVERED, awaiting owner inspection on the live URL. Stages 2–5 are LOCKED: FORBIDDEN to start until the owner explicitly approves Stage 1.5.
- Architectural integrity law (permanent, Stage 1.5 revision): flat floor + plumb walls ALWAYS — walking is real camera translation with sliding collision, NEVER vertex displacement, NEVER FOV zoom (fov fixed 68° desktop / 75° touch). Persian = Vazirmatn always. No naked-oscillator footsteps ever (filtered noise <180 Hz + quiet sub support).
- Stripped modules recoverable from git history commit `3203ae2`.
